# The locally previewed cube (mint form, craft preview) carries the canonical
# cube body, whose `<script src=/content/...>` and side images resolve against
# this origin: a local preview has no `<base href>`, by design. This sends
# those bytes to our own ord, which answers `/content/` with
# `access-control-allow-origin: *` and needs no third party to be reachable
# for the preview to render at all.
/content/* https://api.ordpool.space/content/:splat 301
